<title>UK: Hankyu prices 10 bln yen convertible bond.</title>
<headline>Hankyu prices 10 bln yen convertible bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following convertible bond has been priced, lead manager Daiwa Europe said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HANKYU CORP</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN YEN    COUPON     1.50	MATURITY   *30.SEP.06</p>
<p> TYPE   CONVERTIBLE   ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    22.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	MGT/UND    0.50/0.50 SELL CONC   1.50</p>
<p> PRAECIPUUM 0.35	LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (M)  10</p>
<p> SALE LIMS  US/UK/JPGOV LAW    ENGLISH   TAX PROVS   GROSS-UP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES    * PUT AT 101.50 ON 30.SEP.03</p>
<p>		INITIAL CONVERSION PRICE 680 YEN PER SHARE</p>
<p>		CONVERSION PREMIUM -- 15 PCT</p>
<p>		CONVERSION PERIOD -- 29.OCT.96-22.SEP.06</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
